    {
      "id": "edge-class-page-detail",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Page",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -900,
        "y": -520
      },
      "width": 760,
      "height": 900,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "edge-class-page"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#ffffff;font-family:system-ui'><header data-role='masthead' style='padding:56px 40px 32px'><div style='font:800 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:16px'>EDGE CLASS · evidence.supports</div><h1 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:850 44px/1.05 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Supports</h1><p style='margin:0;font:400 20px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'>A piece of evidence backs a claim.</p></header><section data-role='region' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(200px,280px) 1fr;gap:16px 40px;padding:28px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div><h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;font:800 26px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Settings</h2><p style='margin:0;max-width:26ch;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#64748b'>What this edge class is set to. Put its settings nodes here.</p></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px;align-content:start'><article data-role='entry' style='box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h3 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 16px/1.3 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Settings</h3><p style='margin:0 0 8px;max-width:60ch;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#475569'>Key: evidence.supports<br>Default edge type: reference<br>Route: curved<br>Arrow: end<br>From: idea-evidence<br>To: idea-assumption<br>Strokes: 2 painted</p></article></div></section><section data-role='region' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(200px,280px) 1fr;gap:16px 40px;padding:28px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div><h2 style='margin:0 0 10px;font:800 26px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Description, rationale and evidence</h2><p style='margin:0;max-width:26ch;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Why this edge class exists. Start with the notes here, and add nodes that explain the rationale or show the evidence.</p></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px;align-content:start'><article data-role='entry' style='box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h3 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 16px/1.3 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Description</h3><p style='margin:0 0 8px;max-width:60ch;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#475569'>A supports edge connects a piece of evidence to the claim it backs. It reads: this evidence supports that claim.</p></article><article data-role='entry' style='box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h3 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 16px/1.3 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Rationale</h3><p style='margin:0 0 8px;max-width:60ch;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#475569'>Evidence and claims used to be linked by a plain reference edge, which hid which way the support ran and which links were about evidence at all. A class of its own lets a page list a claim&#39;s evidence and lets a check confirm the two ends.</p></article><article data-role='entry' style='box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h3 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 16px/1.3 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Evidence</h3><p style='margin:0 0 8px;max-width:60ch;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#475569'>The idea template uses it between evidence and assumptions, and an idea built from it lists its evidence without a query.</p></article></div></section></div>"
        }
      }
    },
