        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "edge-class-page"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Edge Class Page\n\nThe page for an edge class definition, at detail size. It has two parts: **Settings**, a list of what the edge class is set to, and **About this edge class**, its description, rationale and evidence.\n\nThe two dashed regions are the two parts, and the notes inside them are an example (a *supports* edge). Replace them with your own, and drag more nodes into a region to add to it. The page in the Detail view lists whatever is in each region, and stays current as you edit.\n\nThe Edge Class Template uses this same layout, with the settings taken live from its properties."
        }
      }
    },
